<section id="bio" class="py-24 bg-surface-void shadow-divider-t">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
    <!-- Left Column: Section Heading & Editorial Photography -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-8">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif font-semibold text-4xl sm:text-5xl tracking-[-0.04em] leading-[1.05] text-surface-ink">
          Bio
        </h2>
        <p class="font-sans font-normal text-base text-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
          Connection through music.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-hairline bg-surface-raised">
        <img
          src="/images/about-banner.webp"
          alt="Ro Halfhide"
          width="2880"
          height="1680"
          loading="lazy"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Offset Verbatim Narrative -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:pt-16 space-y-6 font-sans font-normal">
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed text-surface-ink">
        Ro Halfhide is a singer-songwriter whose music aims to recharge listeners, provide hope, and foster connection. His pop songs are infused with soul and offer a reflection of real life experiences, both the highs and lows, with lyrics and melodies that speak directly to the heart.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-surface-ink/85">
        Ro's background as a fusion of two cultures is a source of inspiration for him in his search for connection in his music and life. The central theme in his music is the message that everyone belongs.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-surface-ink/85">
        Ro has been on Dutch national TV numerous times, in the last years with his band for mentally handicapped people <a
          href="https://www.wimpieendedominos.nl"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-150 rounded-sm focus-ring"
        >Wimpie &amp; de Domino's</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-surface-ink/85">
        Ro has produced albums for well known singer-songwriters like Lucky Fonz III and Case Mayfield. He also toured in Indonesia with Robin Block, a Dutch artist of Indonesian descent.
      </p>

      <p class="pt-6 shadow-divider-t text-sm text-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        For sync &amp; licensing, contact <a
          href="mailto:halfhide@gmail.com"
          class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-150 rounded-sm focus-ring"
        >halfhide@gmail.com</a>. Looking for an acoustic cover duo for private events? Visit <a
          href="https://reaumusic.nl"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-150 rounded-sm focus-ring"
        >ReauMusic.nl</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
